// 拒递归重键、未知字段、重复部队/人物/原因和伪技能等级；完整原入战因果另走具名早晚门。
#include "resident/checkpoint/checkpoint_decode_lifecycle.hpp"
#include "military_command_resources_codec.hpp"
#include "military_command_resources.hpp"
#include "military_officer_codec.hpp"
#include "resident/domains/conditions/domain_codec_util.hpp"
#include "resident/storage/common_checkpoint.hpp"
namespace hanmo::resident::military_command_resources_codec {
namespace {
using namespace domain_codec;
Status wire(const MilitaryCommandResourcesState& s){MilitaryBattleRecord b;b.id="resource_wire";b.created_tick=s.entry_tick;b.rout_retreat_enabled=true;b.commanded_damage=MilitaryCommandedDamageState{};for(const auto& row:s.units){BattleUnit u;u.unit_id=row.unit_id;u.commander_actor_id=row.commander_actor_id;b.units.push_back(std::move(u));}return validate_military_command_resources_shape(b,s);}
Status emit_row(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitaryCommandResourcesUnit& r){w.field("unit_id",r.unit_id);w.field("commander_actor_id",r.commander_actor_id);w.field("authored_actor_id",r.authored_actor_id);w.field("experience",r.experience);w.field("level",r.level);w.sequence("causal_fact_ids",r.causal_fact_ids,[](auto& c,const auto& id){return c.field("",id);});w.order_fields(r.field_order);return w.status();}
MilitaryCommandResourcesUnit row_read(const V& v){const StableId path="command_resources/units";boundary::fields(v,{"unit_id","commander_actor_id","authored_actor_id","experience","level","causal_fact_ids"},{},path);MilitaryCommandResourcesUnit r;r.field_order=boundary::order(v);r.unit_id=boundary::get_string(v,"unit_id",path);r.commander_actor_id=boundary::get_string(v,"commander_actor_id",path);r.authored_actor_id=boundary::get_string(v,"authored_actor_id",path);r.experience=boundary::get_int(v,"experience",path);r.level=boundary::get_int(v,"level",path);for(const auto& id:boundary::array(boundary::field(v,"causal_fact_ids",path),path))r.causal_fact_ids.push_back(boundary::string(id,path));return r;}
Status walk(CodecVisitor& c,MilitaryCommandResourcesUnit& r){c.field("unit_id",r.unit_id);c.field("commander_actor_id",r.commander_actor_id);c.field("authored_actor_id",r.authored_actor_id);c.field("experience",r.experience);c.field("level",r.level);common_checkpoint::strings(c,"causal_fact_ids",r.causal_fact_ids);common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",r.field_order);return c.status();}
}
Status emit_fields(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitaryCommandResourcesState& s){auto checked=wire(s);if(!checked.ok)return checked;w.field("entry_tick",s.entry_tick);w.sequence("units",s.units,[](auto& c,const auto& r){return c.object("",[&](auto& row){return emit_row(row,r);});});w.order_fields(s.field_order);return w.status();}
BoundaryValue encode(const MilitaryCommandResourcesState& s){BoundaryValue out;BoundaryProjectionWriter sink(out);auto checked=sink.object("",[&](auto& w){return emit_fields(w,s);});if(checked.ok)checked=sink.finish();if(!checked.ok)boundary::fail(checked.error.original.code,checked.error.original.path);return out;}
Outcome<MilitaryCommandResourcesState> decode(const BoundaryValue& v){try{auto checked=military_officer_codec::validate_json_unique_keys(v);if(!checked.ok)return {false,{},checked.error};boundary::fields(v,{"entry_tick","units"},{},"command_resources");MilitaryCommandResourcesState s;s.field_order=boundary::order(v);s.entry_tick=boundary::get_int(v,"entry_tick","command_resources");for(const auto& row:boundary::array(boundary::field(v,"units","command_resources"),"units"))s.units.push_back(row_read(row));checked=wire(s);return checked.ok?Outcome<MilitaryCommandResourcesState>{true,std::move(s),{}}:Outcome<MilitaryCommandResourcesState>{false,{},checked.error};}catch(const boundary::DecodeFailure& e){return {false,{},e.error};}}
Status visit(CodecVisitor& c,MilitaryCommandResourcesState& s){if(!(c.schema_features&military_command_resources_checkpoint_feature)||!(c.schema_features&military_commanded_damage_checkpoint_feature))return c.reject("MilitaryCommandResourcesPrerequisiteRequired");c.field("entry_tick",s.entry_tick);c.sequence("units",s.units,[](auto& child,auto& row){return walk(child,row);});common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",s.field_order);if(!c.status().ok)return c.status();auto checked=wire(s);return checked.ok?c.status():c.reject(checked.error.original.code,checked.error.original.path);}
}
